 4/HTX-Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-TCG-Con-X-1.jpg
UID:kdqbpyfTVVkU3S__I0Xm1
SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con X
DTSTAMP:20260724T105422Z
DTSTART:20260807T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:💥 Houston… Round X: From one to ten – What a pull it’s been! 🎉\
	n🎴 Three Days • FREE Entry • 100+ Vendors • Nonstop Trades! \nWhat started
	 as a small weekend card show has turned into a full-on collector movement
	. Houston TCG Con is back at CCS with Round X: a full 3-day weekend built 
	on trades\, collecting\, and community. More time to dig. More time to tra
	de. More time to find something you didn’t even know you needed. 🃏🤝 \n  \n
	📅 Date: August 7-9\, 2026 \n⏰ Time: Friday: 3PM – 10PM | Saturday: 10AM – 
	6PM | Sunday: 10AM – 5PM \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston
	\, TX 77036 \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking! \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 1
	00+ TCG Vendors — The Houston Trade Floor \nShop from 100+ curated vendors
	 from across Texas and beyond. Tables will be stacked with: \n✅ Top titles
	 including Pokémon\, Magic: The Gathering\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, One Piece\, Lorcan
	a\, Digimon\, Weiss Schwarz\, and more. \n✅ Sealed product + booster boxes
	 \n✅ Graded slabs + collector singles \n✅ Binder deals + playable staples 
	\n✅ Japanese imports + hard-to-find pickups \n✅ Sleeves\, top loaders\, st
	orage & accessories \n  \n⚡ Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend \nThis is wha
	t Houston TCG Con is known for. Bring your binders\, make the deals you’ve
	 been waiting for\, and connect with collectors. This is where grails chan
	ge hands and collections level up. \n  \n🤝 Built by the Community — 10 Rou
	nds Strong \nFrom first packs opened around the kitchen table to the cards
	 you still chase today\, this is where it all comes back. The trades\, the
	 stories\, the people you meet along the way\, Round X is a milestone for 
	everyone who grew up with the hobby and never really left it. Bring your c
	rew (and your binder) and relive it with us. Houston TCG Con X is back for
	 a bigger weekend\, with the same community that’s always made it feel lik
	e home. \n  \n🎨 Face Painting Fun | Saturday \nStep away from the tables a
	nd add some extra style to your TCG Con experience with fun face painting 
	designs. ✨ By @will.and.whimsy \n  \n💼 Vendors – Claim Your Spot! \nApply 
	here 👉🏻 https://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \nThis is your chance to connect 
	with the passionate Charlie’s Collectible Show TCG Community! \n  \n🏨 Excl
	usive Hotel Accommodation \nThinking of traveling to Houston for our show?
	 We’ve reserved a special hotel deal just for you: $79/night rate at Towne
	Place Suites – just 15 minutes away from CCS Houston. \n🔗 Book your stay: 
	Here\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-x/\n\nFrom CCS Hous
	ton
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-x/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT55H
END:VEVENT
